  "notes": [
    "**Entrar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **entrado** (regular)",
    "Used with **\"en\"** (Spain) or **\"a\"** (Latin America): *entrar en/a la casa*",
    "Opposite of **salir** (to leave/go out)",
    "Common usage: *entrar en la habitación* (to enter the room), *entrar por la puerta* (to enter through the door)",
    "Can also mean \"to fit\": *No entra en la caja* (It doesn't fit in the box)"
  ],
